        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "4.利用经纬网定位",
          "block_bbox": [
            254,
            450,
            737,
            505
          ],
          "block_id": 1,
          "block_order": 1
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(1)经纬网的含义：在地球仪或地图上经线和纬线相互交织所构成的网络。",
          "block_bbox": [
            322,
            542,
            1991,
            605
          ],
          "block_id": 2,
          "block_order": 2
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(2)经纬网的作用：确定地球表面某一点的位置。",
          "block_bbox": [
            328,
            639,
            1410,
            700
          ],
          "block_id": 3,
          "block_order": 3
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "地球的运动",
          "block_bbox": [
            258,
            830,
            557,
            883
          ],
          "block_id": 4,
          "block_order": 4
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "1.地球的自转",
          "block_bbox": [
            271,
            926,
            606,
            981
          ],
          "block_id": 5,
          "block_order": 5
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(1)含义：地球绕着地轴不停地旋转。",
          "block_bbox": [
            336,
            1017,
            1193,
            1090
          ],
          "block_id": 6,
          "block_order": 6
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(2)方向：自西向东.",
          "block_bbox": [
            343,
            1115,
            755,
            1184
          ],
          "block_id": 7,
          "block_order": 7
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(3)周期：一天(约为24小时).",
          "block_bbox": [
            344,
            1212,
            977,
            1266
          ],
          "block_id": 8,
          "block_order": 8
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(4)产生的现象：昼夜更替、地方时差",
          "block_bbox": [
            346,
            1303,
            1163,
            1373
          ],
          "block_id": 9,
          "block_order": 9
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "2.地球的公转",
          "block_bbox": [
            264,
            1494,
            634,
            1551
          ],
          "block_id": 10,
          "block_order": 10
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(1)含义：地球围绕太阳不停地旋转。",
          "block_bbox": [
            355,
            1588,
            1223,
            1662
          ],
          "block_id": 11,
          "block_order": 11
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(2)方向：自西向东。",
          "block_bbox": [
            359,
            1687,
            787,
            1753
          ],
          "block_id": 12,
          "block_order": 12
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(3)周期：一年(约为365天).",
          "block_bbox": [
            363,
            1781,
            958,
            1836
          ],
          "block_id": 13,
          "block_order": 13
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(4)特点：地球公转的轨道平面与地轴的央角是66.5°",
          "block_bbox": [
            362,
            1867,
            1573,
            1937
          ],
          "block_id": 14,
          "block_order": 14
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(5)产生的现象：",
          "block_bbox": [
            364,
            1972,
            727,
            2029
          ],
          "block_id": 15,
          "block_order": 15
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "①太阳直射点在南北回归线之间来回移动；",
          "block_bbox": [
            428,
            2065,
            1370,
            2129
          ],
          "block_id": 16,
          "block_order": 16
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "②同一地点，太阳高度角的变化：",
          "block_bbox": [
            431,
            2159,
            1128,
            2230
          ],
          "block_id": 17,
          "block_order": 17
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "③同一地点，昼夜长短的变化：",
          "block_bbox": [
            430,
            2254,
            1091,
            2325
          ],
          "block_id": 18,
          "block_order": 18
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "④同一地点，不同季节太阳光热不同，即春夏秋冬四季的形成。",
          "block_bbox": [
            428,
            2345,
            1742,
            2413
          ],
          "block_id": 19,
          "block_order": 19
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "$(6)=\\textcircled{7}-\\textcircled{7}$ ：春分日(3月21日前后)、夏至日(6月22日前后)、秋分日(9日23日前后)、冬至日((2月22日前后)\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            258,
            2441,
            2022,
            2600
          ],
          "block_id": 20,
          "block_order": 20
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(7)四季的划分(以北半球为例，南半球正相反)：",
          "block_bbox": [
